# Canary screen recordings — kept OUT of git deliberately: ~33 MB of WebM that would
# bloat every future clone forever. The evidence survives without them: report.html
# embeds the per-step screenshots, and screenshots/ + network.har + console.log are
# committed. The videos live in the Canary session dirs under ~/.canary/sessions/ and
# are copied into results/canary-*/video/ locally. Force-add if you really want them.
results/**/video/
*.webm
